</table>
</spec>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000007RC009X_02_0033" proc-id="RM0550J___000033900000">
<ptxt>Remove Radiator Upper Air Deflector
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 8 clips and the radiator upper air deflector. </ptxt>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000007RC009X_02_0030" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QL00000">
<ptxt>Disconnect Water Hose Clamp Bracket NO.1</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 2 bolts and disconnect water hose clamp bracket No.1 from the radiator support UPR.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B170164" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000007RC009X_02_0031" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QM00000">
<ptxt>Adjust Hood Sub-assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Adjustment in forward/rearward direction of hood and left/right direction at rear end</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Loosen the bolts of the bonnet (hood) hinge assembly and adjust.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153597" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<torque>
<torqueitem>
<t-value1>13</t-value1>
<t-value2>133</t-value2>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<atten3>
<ptxt>When adjusting, use a service bolt to adjust the fit.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Vertical adjustment of left and right front end of hood</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Turn the 2 cushions on each of the left and right sides to adjust the height.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167273" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Vertical and lateral adjustment of front end of hood</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Loosen the 3 bolts of the bonnet (hood) lock assembly and adjust.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B170163" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<torque>
<torqueitem>
<t-value1>7.5</t-value1>
<t-value2>77</t-value2>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<atten3>
<ptxt>When adjusting, use a service bolt to adjust the fit.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM0000007RC009X_02_0032" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QN00000">
<ptxt>Connect Water Hose Clamp Bracket NO.1</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect water hose clamp bracket No.1 to the radiator support UPR with the 2 bolts.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B170164" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<torque>
<torqueitem>
<t-value1>5.0</t-value1>
<t-value2>51</t-value2>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>